# Fable 5 can't tell you why

Bad. Ask Fable 5 why it did something and it rereads its own output the way you would and writes a plausible story. The story is a guess. Psychology calls this confabulation, and humans do it too<Cite id="nisbett" />. Everything below is from Anthropic's June 2026 system card for this exact model<Cite id="card" />, its API contract, or an experiment you can run yourself.

